          "value": "<ol>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;.... 3 dir. From \u1e6ca\u02be\u016bs, 3.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>.. . .D\u0101r al-\u1e24aff\u0101r : The room of al-Ba\u02bflbak\u012b, 4.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;. the room of b. Sulaym\u0101n, 6 dir.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;. . . . added it up . . . .&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;&hellip;. 2 &frac34; dir. The khu\u1e63\u1e63 . ...&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;. . . . and 1/4; the khu\u1e63\u1e63 of Da\u02be\u016bd, 2 dir.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;.... 2 dir., and completed. In this ..</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;the q\u0101\u02bfa of Umayna&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;&hellip; 70 &frac12;.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;. . . . Rab\u012b\u02bf al-awwal: To begin with, D\u0101r Qu\u1e6day\u1e6d&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;D\u0101r b. \u1e24asan, from the mother of Suhayl&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;. . . . Sahl\u0101n, 5 dir. From al-Magh\u0101zil\u012b&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;. . . . 3 dir. From the qa\u1e63r of \u1e24\u0101m\u016bd,&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;. ... the big room, 5 dir.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;.... from \u1e6ca\u02be\u016bs, 3 dir. D\u0101r&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;. . . . the storeroom, 3 dir. D\u0101r al-\u1e24aff\u0101r</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;&hellip; dir. The room of Ab\u016b Na\u1e63r, 5 dir.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;.... dir. Ben Nehemiah, 5 dir.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;.. . . 2 3&frasl;4 dir. The khu\u1e63\u1e63 of the mother of Rayyisa</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>....The khu\u1e63\u1e63 of the wife of al-\u1e62\u0101\u02beigh, 2 1/2 dir.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>....2 &frac34; dir. The small khu\u1e63\u1e63, 2 dir.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;....the month. The room of Mu\u1e25sin and the q\u0101\u02bfa of Umayna,&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;&hellip;. the revenue of this month, 90.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;. . . the month Rab\u012b\u02bf al-\u0101khir: To begin with : D\u0101r Qu\u1e6day\u1e6d&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;. . . dir. From the mother of Suhayl, 10 dir. From the sister&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;. . . 4 dir. From al-Katt\u0101n\u012b&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;... D\u0101r al-Azraq&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;. . . . Mushrif</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>&nbsp;.... Mu\u1e25sin ....</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
